OL,3,GNEWSAWoman's harassment story
OL,4,Ahighlights 'safeguarding loophole'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe system designed to protect children
OL,7,Fand vulnerable adults "has got its eyes
OL,8,Fclosed" to potential abusers who have
OL,9,Fbeen found to have committed rape,
OL,10,Fdomestic abuse or harassment in civil
OL,11,Fand family courts, a campaign group has
OL,12,Fwarned.
OL,14,FPolice are not routinely informed about
OL,15,Fcivil and family judgements, findings
OL,16,For agreements, meaning they're often
OL,17,Fnot included on Disclosure and Barring
OL,18,FService (DBS) checks which employers
OL,19,Fuse to understand employees'
OL,20,Fbackgrounds.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
